          "type": "code",
          "say": "Pad the array with a one at each end, so the boundaries are real. d p of i, j covers the balloons strictly between i and j. The outer loop runs over the interval length, short to long, because each interval reads shorter ones. Then try every k as the last balloon. For three, one, five, eight, it returns one hundred sixty-seven. O of n cubed time.",
